<!--
  The static routes of an SPA. Kept as a literal list rather than generated:
  the build has no route manifest to walk, and a one-line diff when a page is
  added is easier to trust than a generator nobody reads.

  NO /doctrine/1..11 entries. The eleven manifestos are fetched by the /doctrine
  page itself (/api/doctrine for the list, /api/doctrine/{id} for a document) —
  there is no per-document PAGE, so those URLs would be SPA fallbacks: HTTP 200
  with an error page inside. The first draft of this file listed them anyway,
  because the API has ids for them; a sitemap is a list of pages, not of API
  resources.
-->
